    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf31 Small Farm</strong> is a charming 2D farming simulation game where you create your own cozy farm life. Grow 18 types of crops \ud83e\udd6c, raise animals like cows \ud83d\udc04, sheep \ud83d\udc11, chickens \ud83d\udc14, and pigs \ud83d\udc37, and take care of them with daily brushing \ud83d\udc9e. Sell your produce at the market \ud83e\uddfa, cook delicious meals \ud83c\udf73, go fishing \ud83c\udfa3, explore the forest \ud83c\udf32, and enjoy the relaxing rhythm of rural living \ud83c\udf24\ufe0f.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through a lively village \ud83c\udfd8\ufe0f filled with shops \ud83d\udecd\ufe0f, quirky characters \ud83d\ude04, and seasonal events \ud83c\udf89. Complete quests from the town board \ud83d\udcdc, unlock buildings and features, decorate your home \ud83c\udfe1, customize your character \ud83d\udc57, and even collect adorable cats \ud83d\udc31. There's always something new to discover at your own pace \ud83d\udcab<br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3e Grow crops, raise animals, and upgrade your farm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddfc Brush animals to build affection and improve product quality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f Visit over 10 village shops and interact with a traveling merchant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc5 Complete quests and profit from high-demand product days</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Enjoy fun minigames and take part in seasonal festivals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26cf\ufe0f Mine resources, forage in the wild, fish, and craft clothes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe1 Decorate your house, backyard, and unlock a public park</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc52 Customize your character\u2019s outfit, hair, and accessories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81 Gift items to villagers and receive special items in return</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Collect cats, change background music \ud83c\udfb6, and test your luck \ud83c\udf40!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf31 Small Farm</strong> is a charming 2D farming simulation game where you create your own cozy farm life. Grow 18 types of crops \ud83e\udd6c, raise animals like cows \ud83d\udc04, sheep \ud83d\udc11, chickens \ud83d\udc14, and pigs \ud83d\udc37, and take care of them with daily brushing \ud83d\udc9e. Sell your produce at the market \ud83e\uddfa, cook delicious meals \ud83c\udf73, go fishing \ud83c\udfa3, explore the forest \ud83c\udf32, and enjoy the relaxing rhythm of rural living \ud83c\udf24\ufe0f.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through a lively village \ud83c\udfd8\ufe0f filled with shops \ud83d\udecd\ufe0f, quirky characters \ud83d\ude04, and seasonal events \ud83c\udf89. Complete quests from the town board \ud83d\udcdc, unlock buildings and features, decorate your home \ud83c\udfe1, customize your character \ud83d\udc57, and even collect adorable cats \ud83d\udc31. There's always something new to discover at your own pace \ud83d\udcab<br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3e Grow crops, raise animals, and upgrade your farm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddfc Brush animals to build affection and improve product quality</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f Visit over 10 village shops and interact with a traveling merchant</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc5 Complete quests and profit from high-demand product days</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Enjoy fun minigames and take part in seasonal festivals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26cf\ufe0f Mine resources, forage in the wild, fish, and craft clothes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe1 Decorate your house, backyard, and unlock a public park</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc52 Customize your character\u2019s outfit, hair, and accessories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf81 Gift items to villagers and receive special items in return</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Collect cats, change background music \ud83c\udfb6, and test your luck \ud83c\udf40!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "\ud83c\udf3e A cute and cozy 2D farming game \ud83d\udc14 Grow crops, raise animals, cook meals \ud83c\udf73, fish \ud83c\udfa3, and sell goods at the market \ud83e\uddfa. Upgrade your farm and enjoy relaxing minigames \ud83c\udfae in a stress-free, wholesome experience \ud83d\udc97",
